customer: nice_lady
problem: hamster
brief:
	Her child's hamster crept into the computer and lies on the fan. The symptoms are the Skater's (Dust Overheat) on purpose: the player finds the difference by opening it. The fan is fine; swapping it changes nothing.

== drop-off
(happy) Oh, hello dear. Isn't this rain something?
+ Did you get wet?
	(happy) Only a little. I had the computer under my coat.
+ So, what's your problem?
	(problem) It starts, and then it just switches itself off again.
	(neutral) And it smells a bit funny. Like a pet shop.
	+ Any pets at home?
		(happy) Only the children's hamster, Nibbles. He got out on Sunday, the little rascal.
	- OK, leave it with me. [end]
		(happy) Thank you, dear. No rush.

== pick-up
(happy) It works! Oh, and you didn't see a hamster anywhere, did you?
